            <title>[LU-20836] kernel update [RHEL 8.10 4.18.0-553.168.1.el8_10]</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20836</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Security Fix(es) for kernel 4.18.0-553.168.1.el8_10:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: drm/amdgpu: Fix fence put before wait in amdgpu_amdkfd_submit_ib (CVE-2026-31566)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: netfilter: nf_queue: hold bridge skb-&amp;gt;dev while queued (CVE-2026-52912)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: Linux kernel: PPPoE memory corruption via stale pointer (CVE-2026-68121)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: Linux kernel IPVS: Denial of Service due to stale memory references (CVE-2026-80714)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: nvme-tcp: reject a read that transferred too few bytes (CVE-2026-89480)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
